type: software
title: "affective-relief-audit: generator, tests, results and supplement for 'A generative rule from affect to tactile relief'"
abstract: >-
  A generator reconstructed from the description in the preprint of a rule that maps valence and arousal to a
  procedural height map, with the tests, the specification, the conditions fixed before each computation, the
  scripts, the results and the supplement of the paper.
